                <text type="forecast">The chance of a thunderstorm with little or no rainfall in the morning. Sunny day. Winds east to northeasterly 20 to 30 km/h tending northwest to southwesterly during the morning then tending south to southwesterly 25 to 40 km/h during the afternoon. Overnight temperatures falling to between 13 and 18 with daytime temperatures reaching 29 to 35.</text>
